#, python-format
msgid ""
"The character's day against the rest of their corporation's, hour by hour. "
"Shares rather than counts, because one character never has the volume of a "
"corporation. The shaded hours are the corporation's busiest %(hours)s."
msgstr ""
"La journée du Character face au reste de sa corporation, heure par heure. "
"Des parts plutôt que des décomptes, car un Character n'a jamais le volume "
"d'une corporation. Les heures ombrées sont les %(hours)s les plus actives de "
"la corporation."

