"How large a move of a corporation's own tax rate has to be\n"
"                                    before that page reports it."
msgstr ""
"De combien le propre taux de taxe d'une corporation doit varier avant que "
"cette page ne le signale."

#: templates/eos_tax/settings.html:174 templates/eos_tax/settings.html:213
msgid "Recalculate"
msgstr "Recalculer"

#: templates/eos_tax/settings.html:176
msgid ""
"Runs the calculation again for one month, outside the\n"
"                                    periodic task - useful right after a "
"journal import finished or a rate was\n"
"                                    corrected. One corporation runs "
"immediately and shows the arithmetic behind its\n"
"                                    figure; every corporation is queued the "
"way the periodic task queues them,\n"
"                                    without waiting for the result here."
msgstr ""
"Relance le calcul d'un mois, en dehors de la tâche périodique - utile juste "
"après la fin d'un import de journal ou la correction d'un taux. Une "
"corporation s'exécute immédiatement et affiche l'arithmétique derrière son "
"chiffre ; chaque corporation est mise en file d'attente comme le fait la "
"tâche périodique, sans attendre le résultat ici."

#: templates/eos_tax/settings.html:189
msgid "All configured corporations"
msgstr "Toutes les Corporations configurées"

#: templates/eos_tax/settings.html:206 templates/eos_tax/statistics.html:17
#: templates/eos_tax/tax-changes.html:26
msgid "Year"
msgstr "Année"

#: templates/eos_tax/settings.html:226
msgid ""
"Four readings of the same month, each with its own\n"
"                                    thresholds. A character at the top of "
"one can be absent from the next, and\n"
"                                    that disagreement is the point."
msgstr ""
"Quatre lectures du même mois, chacune avec ses propres seuils. Un Character "
"en tête de l'une peut être absent de la suivante, et ce désaccord est "
"précisément le but."

#: templates/eos_tax/settings.html:247
msgid ""
"Counts how many different hours of a day a character\n"
"                                            earned in, and on how many days."
msgstr ""
"Compte dans combien d'heures différentes d'une journée un Character a gagné, "
"et sur combien de jours."

#: templates/eos_tax/settings.html:262
msgid ""
"Looks at the minute rather than the hour: the game pays a\n"
"                                            ratter about every twenty "
"minutes, so an uninterrupted stretch shows up as a\n"
"                                            chain of payouts and nothing "
"else does."
msgstr ""
"S'intéresse à la minute plutôt qu'à l'heure : le jeu paie qui chasse les NPC "
"toutes les vingt minutes environ, si bien qu'une plage ininterrompue "
"apparaît comme une chaîne de versements, et rien d'autre."

#: templates/eos_tax/settings.html:279
msgid ""
"How much of a character's income falls inside the hours\n"
"                                            their own corporation is busy. "
"The corporation is the yardstick and not the\n"
"                                            alliance, which spans several "
"timezones at once."
msgstr ""
"Quelle part du revenu d'un Character tombe dans les heures où sa propre "
"corporation est active. La corporation est la référence, et non l'alliance, "
"qui couvre plusieurs fuseaux horaires à la fois."

#: templates/eos_tax/settings.html:297
msgid ""
"How far a character's day sits from their corporation's,\n"
"                                            averaged the way a clock wraps."
msgstr ""
"À quelle distance la journée d'un Character se situe de celle de sa "
"corporation, moyennée comme le fait une horloge."

#: templates/eos_tax/settings.html:313
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Enregistrer les paramètres"

#: templates/eos_tax/statistics.html:28
msgid "All alliances"
msgstr "Toutes les Alliances"

#: templates/eos_tax/statistics.html:36
msgid "Display"
msgstr "Affichage"

#: templates/eos_tax/statistics.html:38
msgid "Trend over the year"
msgstr "Évolution sur l'année"

#: templates/eos_tax/statistics.html:39
msgid "Share of one month"
msgstr "Répartition d'un mois"

#: templates/eos_tax/statistics.html:54
msgid "Min. share"
msgstr "Part minimale"

#: templates/eos_tax/statistics.html:92
msgid "PvE income"
msgstr "Revenu PvE"

#: templates/eos_tax/statistics.html:117
msgid "No tax data recorded yet."
msgstr "Aucune donnée de taxe enregistrée pour l'instant."

#: templates/eos_tax/tax-change-detail.html:17
msgid ""
"The share of the full bounty that reached the corporation, per day.\n"
"                The value carries the system's bounty modifier as well as "
"the rate, so the level itself\n"
"                means little - a step in it does not."
msgstr ""
"La part de la bounty complète parvenue à la corporation, par jour. La valeur "
"porte le taux ainsi que le bounty modifier du système, le niveau en lui-même "
"dit donc peu de chose ; une marche, si."

#: templates/eos_tax/tax-change-detail.html:20
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A level counts once it held for at least two days, and a move of at least "
"%(minimum)s percentage points separates one level from the next."
msgstr ""
"Un niveau compte dès qu'il a tenu au moins deux jours, et au moins "
"%(minimum)s points de pourcentage séparent un niveau du suivant."

#: templates/eos_tax/tax-change-detail.html:33
msgid "The stretches of days the rate held, and the steps between them"
msgstr "Les périodes où le taux a tenu, et les marches entre elles"

#: templates/eos_tax/tax-change-detail.html:37
msgid "From"
msgstr "Du"

#: templates/eos_tax/tax-change-detail.html:38
msgid "To"
msgstr "Au"

#: templates/eos_tax/tax-change-detail.html:39
msgid "Share of the bounty"
msgstr "Part de la bounty"

#: templates/eos_tax/tax-change-detail.html:40
msgid "Days"
msgstr "Jours"

#: templates/eos_tax/tax-change-detail.html:61
#, python-format
msgid ""
"On %(on)s the share moved from %(before)s percent to %(after)s percent, in "
"%(counter)s system."
msgid_plural ""
"On %(on)s the share moved from %(before)s percent to %(after)s percent, "
"across %(counter)s systems."
msgstr[0] ""
"Le %(on)s la part est passée de %(before)s pour cent à %(after)s pour cent, "
"dans %(counter)s système."
msgstr[1] ""
"Le %(on)s la part est passée de %(before)s pour cent à %(after)s pour cent, "
"dans %(counter)s systèmes."

#: templates/eos_tax/tax-change-detail.html:69
#, python-format
msgid "%(value)s payouts"
msgstr "%(value)s versements"

#: templates/eos_tax/tax-change-detail.html:70
#, python-format
msgid "%(value)s days measured"
msgstr "%(value)s jours mesurés"

#: templates/eos_tax/tax-change-detail.html:78
msgid "Not enough payouts in this year to measure a rate."
msgstr "Trop peu de versements cette année pour mesurer un taux."

#: templates/eos_tax/tax-changes.html:16
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The corporation wallet only shows the corporation's own cut, so the ingame\n"
"                rate is not in it directly. It is recovered from the kills "
"behind each bounty: what the\n"
"                NPCs were worth against what arrived. Every move of that "
"share by at least\n"
"                %(minimum)s percentage points is listed, as long as the new "
"level held for two\n"
"                days - a corporation that switched three times appears three "
"times. The minimum\n"
"                is set on the settings page."
msgstr ""
"Le wallet de la corporation ne montre que sa propre part, l'ingame rate n'y "
"figure donc pas. Il est reconstitué à partir des kills derrière chaque "
"bounty : ce que valaient les NPC face à ce qui est arrivé. Chaque mouvement "
"de cette part d'au moins %(minimum)s points de pourcentage est listé, dès "
"lors que le nouveau niveau a tenu deux jours : une corporation qui a changé "
"trois fois apparaît trois fois. Le minimum se règle dans les paramètres."

#: templates/eos_tax/tax-changes.html:41
